{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q37129","formula":"CH₄","hill":"CH4","elements":["H","C"],"composition":{"C":1.0,"H":4.0},"names":{"en":"Methane","ru":"Метан","uk":"Метан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Methane (US: METH-ayn, UK: MEE-thayn) is a chemical compound that has the chemical formula CH4 (one carbon atom bonded to four hydrogen atoms). It is a group-14 hydride, the simplest alkane, and the main constituent of natural gas. The abundance of methane on Earth makes it an economically attractive fuel, although capturing and storing it is difficult because it is a gas at standard temperature and pressure.","ru":"Мета́н (лат. methanum; болотный газ, CH4) — простейший по составу предельный углеводород, при нормальных условиях бесцветный газ без вкуса и запаха. Малорастворим в воде, почти в два раза легче воздуха.","uk":"Мета́н — найпростіша органічна сполука вуглецю з воднем, природний безбарвний газ без запаху, хімічна формула — CH4. Метан є основною складовою природного газу. Крім того, він міститься в кам'яновугільних пластах — під час їхньої розробки утворюються вибухонебезпечні суміші метану з повітрям, так званий «рудниковий газ»."},"fame":119,"pubchemCid":297,"mass":16.043,"charge":0,"smiles":"C","inchikey":"VNWKTOKETHGBQD-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"methane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"297","atoms":5,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.554,"y":0.8,"z":0.496,"el":"H"},{"x":0.683,"y":-0.813,"z":-0.254,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.778,"y":-0.373,"z":0.669,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.459,"y":0.387,"z":-0.912,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,1,1],[0,2,1],[0,3,1],[0,4,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q37129","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methane","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/297","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},{"role":"structure","name":"PubChem 3D","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/297#section=3D-Conformer","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q1216189","formula":"CH₄","names":{"en":"(2H4)methane"},"elements":["H","C"],"fame":2,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q52858","formula":"C₂H₆","names":{"en":"Ethane","ru":"Этан","uk":"Етан"},"elements":["H","C"],"fame":82,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q3333706","formula":"CH₃⁺","names":{"en":"Methenium"},"elements":["H","C"],"fame":11,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q6823951","formula":"CH₃","names":{"en":"Methyl"},"elements":["H","C"],"fame":9,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q3333513","formula":"CH₅⁺","names":{"en":"Methanium"},"elements":["H","C"],"fame":8,"kind":null},{"id":"Q37497367","formula":"NH₅","names":{"en":"Nitrogen pentahydride"},"elements":["H","N"],"fame":4,"kind":null},{"id":"Q190901","formula":"H₄N⁺","names":{"en":"Ammonium cation","ru":"Аммоний","uk":"Амоній"},"elements":["H","N"],"fame":62,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q2031142","formula":"C₆H₁₈W","names":{"en":"Hexamethyltungsten"},"elements":["H","C","W"],"fame":14,"kind":"crystal"}],"photo":null}